{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616180/extras/be4353d0b0277ad8bbb604969cc13b85.avif?t=1751521908\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616180/extras_big/be4353d0b0277ad8bbb604969cc13b85.avif?t=1751521908 width=800 height=117 /></span>Thirty-three years ago, under the direct order of Viceroy Beasemon, a secret strike team doubling as an entertainment company was covertly established. Its purpose was unambiguous: curb the ascension of the self-proclaimed 'Six Stars', a ferociously cool, criminal organization with machinations of world domination. Now they're back and more determined than ever with the aid of their mysterious weapon, the Zenzicube! As the newly assigned company director, assemble and train a team of heroes to take on the Six Stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616180/extras/a4ed3a3bc88ac9b42045830b674f8c6f.poster.avif?t=1751521908\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616180/extras/a4ed3a3bc88ac9b42045830b674f8c6f.webm?t=1751521908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616180/extras/a4ed3a3bc88ac9b42045830b674f8c6f.mp4?t=1751521908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zenzicube: The Power of Six mixes roster management with 3D adventure, designed around short but intense rounds of matching your heroes with incoming quests, including occasional micro-games sprinkled in between to keep you on your toes. But don't forget to explore your headquarters to recruit new heroes, complete side quests, engage in mini-games, and just soak up the 5th-generation console-inspired graphics. This hub area will also change and expand as you progress through each chapter, so keep an eye out for new things to see and do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616180/extras/fe0f2ec35740b34a48bf3a50ca9ed413.poster.avif?t=1751521908\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616180/extras/fe0f2ec35740b34a48bf3a50ca9ed413.webm?t=1751521908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616180/extras/fe0f2ec35740b34a48bf3a50ca9ed413.mp4?t=1751521908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you've sufficiently weakened one of the Six Stars via questing, you can take them on directly. First by solving puzzles, fighting monsters, and exploring their hideouts in fully third-person adventure gameplay. Then it comes down to a classic, one-on-one boss fight, each with its own mechanics and strategies. Take down the Six Stars one by one until you've reached the very top, and end the Zenzicube threat once and for all! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616180/extras/3a4effa9be7401d4d5aaad1cde628d69.avif?t=1751521908\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616180/extras_big/3a4effa9be7401d4d5aaad1cde628d69.avif?t=1751521908 width=800 height=117 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage a roster of unique heroes, each with their own skills and personalities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short, intense, round-based gameplay where efficiently assigning heroes to quests is key</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combines 3D and pre-rendered backgrounds inspired by the 5th-generation consoles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore compact dungeons and take on boss fights for each of the Six Stars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An evolving hub area to explore and hang out in</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete side quests and get to know team members via private conversations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini-games and micro-games to keep things fresh and engaging\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616180/extras/4af46d4b527ab3b455115d2f26a9d22f.poster.avif?t=1751521908\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616180/extras/4af46d4b527ab3b455115d2f26a9d22f.webm?t=1751521908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616180/extras/4af46d4b527ab3b455115d2f26a9d22f.mp4?t=1751521908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3616180?t=1751521908","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616180/e50a720d4964b2eb6e071e8e43bb94de31d9f51f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751521908","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616180/edfee9fdbcfed6e2d45c1bbd06dfc97c03948fe9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751521908","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616180/edfee9fdbcfed6e2d45c1bbd06dfc97c03948fe9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751521908","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3779550,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616180/extras/be4353d0b0277ad8bbb604969cc13b85.avif?t=1751521908\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616180/extras_big/be4353d0b0277ad8bbb604969cc13b85.avif?t=1751521908 width=800 height=117 /></span>Thirty-three years ago, under the direct order of Viceroy Beasemon, a secret strike team doubling as an entertainment company was covertly established. Its purpose was unambiguous: curb the ascension of the self-proclaimed 'Six Stars', a ferociously cool, criminal organization with machinations of world domination. Now they're back and more determined than ever with the aid of their mysterious weapon, the Zenzicube! As the newly assigned company director, assemble and train a team of heroes to take on the Six Stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616180/extras/a4ed3a3bc88ac9b42045830b674f8c6f.poster.avif?t=1751521908\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616180/extras/a4ed3a3bc88ac9b42045830b674f8c6f.webm?t=1751521908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616180/extras/a4ed3a3bc88ac9b42045830b674f8c6f.mp4?t=1751521908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zenzicube: The Power of Six mixes roster management with 3D adventure, designed around short but intense rounds of matching your heroes with incoming quests, including occasional micro-games sprinkled in between to keep you on your toes. But don't forget to explore your headquarters to recruit new heroes, complete side quests, engage in mini-games, and just soak up the 5th-generation console-inspired graphics. This hub area will also change and expand as you progress through each chapter, so keep an eye out for new things to see and do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616180/extras/fe0f2ec35740b34a48bf3a50ca9ed413.poster.avif?t=1751521908\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616180/extras/fe0f2ec35740b34a48bf3a50ca9ed413.webm?t=1751521908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616180/extras/fe0f2ec35740b34a48bf3a50ca9ed413.mp4?t=1751521908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you've sufficiently weakened one of the Six Stars via questing, you can take them on directly. First by solving puzzles, fighting monsters, and exploring their hideouts in fully third-person adventure gameplay. Then it comes down to a classic, one-on-one boss fight, each with its own mechanics and strategies. Take down the Six Stars one by one until you've reached the very top, and end the Zenzicube threat once and for all! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616180/extras/3a4effa9be7401d4d5aaad1cde628d69.avif?t=1751521908\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616180/extras_big/3a4effa9be7401d4d5aaad1cde628d69.avif?t=1751521908 width=800 height=117 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage a roster of unique heroes, each with their own skills and personalities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short, intense, round-based gameplay where efficiently assigning heroes to quests is key</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combines 3D and pre-rendered backgrounds inspired by the 5th-generation consoles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore compact dungeons and take on boss fights for each of the Six Stars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An evolving hub area to explore and hang out in</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete side quests and get to know team members via private conversations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini-games and micro-games to keep things fresh and engaging\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616180/extras/4af46d4b527ab3b455115d2f26a9d22f.poster.avif?t=1751521908\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616180/extras/4af46d4b527ab3b455115d2f26a9d22f.webm?t=1751521908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616180/extras/4af46d4b527ab3b455115d2f26a9d22f.mp4?t=1751521908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","developers":["Disc Two"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616180/2a1b52b53528240ccdf3698a70c9441a3690d9df/header.jpg?t=1751521908","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_tr