e20c3a064ffb17c1ccce08135d4132.600x338.jpg?t=1751521908"},{"id":14,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616180/4d0c81385771d4da3d3999c396dd6044404ca347/ss_4d0c81385771d4da3d3999c396dd6044404ca347.1920x1080.jpg?t=1751521908","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616180/4d0c81385771d4da3d3999c396dd6044404ca347/ss_4d0c81385771d4da3d3999c396dd6044404ca347.600x338.jpg?t=1751521908"}],"short_description":"Recruit, train, and manage a team of heroes to vanquish the dastardly Six Stars. In short, round-based sessions, send them on quests that match their skills to maximize rewards. Explore a town of colorful characters and engage in action-based combat.","steam_appid":3616180,"support_info":{"email":"","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/disctwo.bsky.social"},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":null}